  "interpretation": "The selector did not merely choose the wrong subset. No five-camera subset is jointly strict-safe for any calibration-frame cell at K4 or K8, and nine-camera K4 also has no strict-safe cell. K8 makes gradient and observation individually feasible on all 52 cells, but field remains infeasible on all 52; the active bottleneck is therefore low-depth field-reference or representation adequacy.",
